WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.453 --> 00:00:04.747
- Pets love us unconditionally

00:00:04.747 --> 00:00:06.988
and they don't judge us.

00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:10.161
Being up here and having
a place for the dogs

00:00:10.161 --> 00:00:13.328
makes all the difference in the world.

00:00:14.426 --> 00:00:16.110
I know you're happy.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.749
I'm glad.

00:00:17.749 --> 00:00:19.569
- Dog mountain in the Dog Chapel

00:00:19.569 --> 00:00:22.428
is an open dog park where
dogs can really connect

00:00:22.428 --> 00:00:25.288
with nature and enjoy
spending time outdoors

00:00:25.288 --> 00:00:27.455
with their owners.

00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:29.566
And having a place like the Dog Chapel

00:00:29.566 --> 00:00:31.684
really helps people say goodbye

00:00:31.684 --> 00:00:33.040
or also leave a little message

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.623
about how much they loved them.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.780
It was basically started
by artist Stephen Huneck.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.805
And he said the worst
thing he ever heard is,

00:00:42.805 --> 00:00:44.138
“It's just a dog.”

00:00:45.302 --> 00:00:47.035
That's why Stephen built the Dog Chapel

00:00:47.035 --> 00:00:50.423
to memorialize these wonderful creatures

00:00:50.423 --> 00:00:53.995
that have touched our lives so much.

00:00:53.995 --> 00:00:55.526
We've got people that pilgrimage

00:00:55.526 --> 00:00:59.237
from every state and every continent

00:00:59.237 --> 00:01:01.470
just to bask in the walls of the chapel

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.550
and leave a little message behind.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:05.579
They take comfort in knowing

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:07.746
that those pictures and those messages

00:01:07.746 --> 00:01:10.329
will be here for years to come.

00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:16.064
- I think dogs can bring
out the best of us.

00:01:16.064 --> 00:01:19.627
And yeah, it's horrific to say goodbye

00:01:19.627 --> 00:01:23.352
but that's true of so
many loses in our lives.

00:01:23.352 --> 00:01:25.074
There are some places of reverence up here

00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:26.923
I think for a lot of
people, however they choose

00:01:26.923 --> 00:01:28.423
to recognize that.

00:01:29.572 --> 00:01:32.376
- Dogs are really special
and it's one of a kind place

00:01:32.376 --> 00:01:35.313
that we have here that
allows dog to really shine

00:01:35.313 --> 00:01:37.368
and be cherished as the wonderful

00:01:37.368 --> 00:01:39.181
little creatures that they are.

00:01:39.181 --> 00:01:41.931
(peaceful music)

